1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,640
Leyan

3
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,120
Teacher, I've finished the painting.

4
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,680
The brushwork is exquisite.

5
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:58,680
But…

6
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,400
it lacks a soul.

7
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,800
"Spring Comes Late."

8
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,200
Last night brought word of spring.

9
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,040
My heart rejoices in secret.

10
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,280
My springtime longing is quietly sent.

11
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,400
Only spring knows the affairs of spring.

12
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,160
Is this "Spring Comes Late"?

13
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,520
Since Lingyi passed away,

14
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,560
every day has felt like
walking on thin ice.

15
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:36,320
The winter has been long,

16
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,200
and spring seems forever out of reach.

17
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,520
But that day,

18
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,280
when I laid down the dagger before you,

19
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,280
I finally came to understand.

20
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,680
The dead are gone.

21
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:51,760
The living must live for themselves.

22
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,160
Leyan.

23
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:56,400
You gave me a new life.

24
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,640
From now on,

25
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,080
I want to live for myself once more.

26
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,360
Teacher, if you can think this way,

27
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,440
then nothing could be better.

28
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,720
Some time ago,

29
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,720
when I saw you so grief-stricken,

30
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,640
yet still helping Director Meng
fight corruption,

31
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,800
I admired you deeply,

32
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:13,760
but worried about you day and night.

33
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:17,000
So I painted this spring scene

34
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,160
as a gift for you.

35
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,520
Leyan.

36
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,200
All of this is because of you.

37
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,960
Only when I'm beside you

38
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,760
can I truly be myself.

39
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,680
I know teacher and
student have their bounds.

40
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,000
The road ahead will be difficult,

41
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,280
but if I persist…

42
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,880
Leyan.

43
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,480
Would you be willing,

44
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,600
to be brave for me once?

45
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,440
I never understood what love was.

46
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,440
But I saw my parents stand by each other,

47
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,440
supporting one another.

48
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,000
I saw my brother

49
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:13,240
risk everything to find
medicine for Miss Yan.

50
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,400
And I saw you,

51
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,640
Teacher, broken by grief.

52
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,080
Only then did I understand

53
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,800
that love

54
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,440
can make one face death without regret,

55
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,360
and suffer pain that pierces the heart.

56
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:32,080
I do not want to be trapped by convention

57
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,440
or bound by old proprieties.

58
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,880
Before, you had a family,

59
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,720
so I dared not cross the line.

60
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,560
But today,

61
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,320
I want to say this boldly.

62
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,680
Teacher,

63
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,240
I also have feelings for you.

64
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,240
This gift…

65
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,560
I prepared it long ago.

66
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,720
Today I can finally give it to you.

67
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,120
It is a Heart-Lock.

68
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,320
The cloud patterns on it

69
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:24,400
were each drawn by my own hand.

70
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:27,040
Let this heart be the lock,

71
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,520
and the clear wind be the key.

72
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:32,000
From now on, seeing this lock
will recall our first resolve.

73
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,880
May we live this life without regret.

74
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,280
I want to protect you for a lifetime.

75
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,280
Would you be willing,

76
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:07,760
to be brave for me once?

77
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:43,600
Who are you, barging into my residence?

78
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,200
You have some nerve.

79
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:48,160
Not as much as you, Right Chancellor.

80
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:50,000
You raised the Tiger's
Roar Gang as your claws,

81
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:52,120
and once you'd used them up,

82
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,960
even your own flesh-and-blood brother

83
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,320
was someone you could murder.

84
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,400
A skulking coward like you

85
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,120
dares threaten me with such nonsense?

86
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,600
Every dirty deal you made with Ling Yunfei

87
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,080
is enough to condemn your entire clan.

88
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,440
Who are you?

89
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,960
How do you know so much?

90
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,040
Who I am is unimportant.

91
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,720
What matters is that within three days,

92
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,600
you hand over Qingzhou's garrison map.

93
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:29,120
Otherwise, you wouldn't
want copies of this ledger

94
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,920
on Meng Tinghui's desk, would you?

95
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,440
The garrison map is a state secret.

96
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:41,560
If I steal it for you,

97
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,760
I will still die when the truth comes out.

98
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:47,520
Do you think doing nothing will save you?

99
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,960
Meng Tinghui will soon
trace it all to you.

100
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:54,480
If you sit and wait, you will still die.

101
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,000
If you cooperate,

102
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:00,800
I can offer you a way out.

103
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,160
What way?

104
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,520
Help your prized student, Shen Zhili,

105
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,640
become Empress.

106
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,920
When a new reign begins,

107
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,320
you will remain chief of the officials.

108
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,320
And should disaster strike,

109
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:19,240
she will be your best safeguard.

110
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,840
If we're to cooperate,

111
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,000
we should be honest with each other.

112
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,760
I need to know who you are as well.

113
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,680
You're back.

114
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,760
You went to the Gu residence again.

115
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,760
That is my business. It
has nothing to do with you.

116
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,760
Between us,

117
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,320
can we not even speak anymore?

118
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:01,160
Ever since you learned
what the peachwood meant,

119
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,480
you've been avoiding me.

120
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,840
How long will you keep running from me?

121
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,840
It isn't that we cannot speak.

122
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,880
There are simply things
you should not say.

123
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:15,240
Anian, you're still young.

124
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,000
My feelings have nothing to do with age.

125
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:19,200
When my whole family was gone but me,

126
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:21,880
you used your handkerchief

127
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,560
to bandage my injured palm.

128
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:24,840
You told me mastering martial arts

129
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:26,080
was the best way to honor them.

130
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:27,720
It was also you

131
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:30,400
who brought me close to
your parents and brother,

132
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:32,360
and had me spar with His
Majesty and Huang Bo.

133
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,480
You stayed beside me
through my darkest days.

134
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,000
From then on, I swore

135
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,680
I would grow up quickly and protect you.

136
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,360
Anian.

137
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:43,920
You've misunderstood.

138
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:47,040
In my heart, you're a younger brother.

139
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,240
I have misunderstood nothing.

140
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,160
I know exactly what I feel.

141
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,840
Besides,

142
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,560
we share no blood relation.

143
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,720
You call my parents Father and Mother,

144
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:57,960
and Zhishu your brother.

145
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,560
Is that not family affection?

146
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,920
Wouldn't that make things easier?

147
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:05,000
If we end up together someday,

148
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,520
we won't even need to
change how we address them.

149
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,200
Stop twisting my words.

150
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,040
I'm older than you, so I am your sister.

151
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,960
You're still young.

152
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,640
Perhaps you cannot yet
tell what you truly feel.

153
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:17,120
When you meet a better woman someday,

154
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,680
you'll understand the difference.

155
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:24,120
There is no woman better than you.

156
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,080
Zhili.

157
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:28,360
I have long known my own heart.

158
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,480
But what about you?

159
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,960
Can you truly tell what you feel for him?

160
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,600
I know my own heart.

161
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,240
I need no one else's judgment.

162
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,960
So in your heart,

163
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,560
compared with the Right Chancellor,

164
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,720
I have become an outsider.

165
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:54,520
I knew confessing to you today

166
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,280
would create distance between us.

167
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,440
But I do not regret it.

168
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,640
I will wait as long as it takes.

169
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,400
Even if it takes a lifetime,

170
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,320
I will still wait.

171
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,480
Calm down first.

172
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,640
Don't let impulse ruin what we have.

173
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:11,360
I left the peachwood in your room.

174
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,920
I have made myself very clear.

175
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Don't…

176
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:20,000
You like reading old laws and statutes.

177
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,360
Whenever you go out,

178
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,720
you always bring so many bamboo slips.

179
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,680
I thought they were cumbersome to search,

180
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,640
so I took the cases and statutes
you consult most often

181
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,160
and recopied them all here.

182
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,440
I made the writing larger,

183
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,840
so when you read at night,

184
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:33,920
you won't strain your eyes.

185
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,760
You needn't feel burdened.

186
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:40,120
I don't ask that you return my feelings.

187
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,880
I only hope

188
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,840
you can be with the one you truly love…

189
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:46,080
side by side.

190
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:09,840
Provisions are the lifeblood of an army.

191
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,840
Pang Mu's negligence cost us the grain.

192
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:12,760
Execute him at once.

193
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,760
General Huo, Lord Shen,

194
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,680
have mercy!

195
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,400
Lord Shen.

196
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,560
Although it was under Pang Mu's watch

197
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:20,200
that the court's thirty thousand
shi of grain was lost,

198
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:22,560
but the raiders were trained and fierce.

199
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:23,720
His crime does not warrant death.

200
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:24,840
Does not warrant death?

201
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,760
Beijian cavalry is
barely a hundred li away.

202
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,040
If they exploit this opening now,

203
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,040
and our forces lack provisions,

204
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,560
Qingzhou's defenses could fall.

205
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,960
We need not wait for His
Majesty's punishment.

206
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:33,760
You may all kill yourselves in apology.

207
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,720
Take him away.

208
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,440
General Huo.

209
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,800
General Huo!

210
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,320
Lord Shen!

211
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:41,240
Lord Shen!

212
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,240
Our priority is finding grain.

213
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,480
I've sent an urgent report to court,

214
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:45,760
but the allocation process is cumbersome.

215
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,880
Distant aid may come too late.

216
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:50,040
The granaries around Qingzhou

217
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,800
can sustain us for only seven days.

218
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:55,360
Have the troops hold out for seven days.

219
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,080
As for the thirty thousand shi,

220
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:58,560
I will find a way.

221
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,280
Your Majesty.

222
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,800
Your Majesty!

223
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:07,880
My brother sent a letter.

224
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:14,800
Your Majesty, I have infiltrated
the Blood Moon Society.

225
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,000
My investigation shows

226
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,880
its leader uses the alias Mr. Shangguan

227
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,440
and is likely hiding in the capital.

228
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,600
Zhongwan remnants are
entrenched in Qingzhou

229
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,880
and are conspiring with Beijian,

230
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:25,160
using the stolen grain
to provoke a border war.

231
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,560
I have planted agents among them.

232
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,160
But the military situation is urgent.

233
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,840
Please prepare defenses at once.

234
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:32,560
Beijian has long coveted
Qingzhou's iron mines.

235
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:34,480
If the Zhongwan remnants
tempt them with that,

236
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:36,640
Beijian may betray us

237
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,560
and tear up the treaty.

238
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,280
If Zhongwan and Beijian join forces,

239
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:42,480
war may erupt along the border.

240
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,040
Issue orders at once.

241
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,800
Have the Ministry of War
send grain to Qingzhou,

242
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:48,120
and secretly deploy Shazhou Camp elites.

243
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,800
Have Zhishu find a chance to disrupt

244
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,440
the Zhongwan-Beijian conspiracy.

245
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,720
But remind him

246
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,680
his own safety comes first.

247
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,640
I'll see to it at once.

248
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:11,880
Chairman Chen, rest assured.

249
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:14,280
The contract will reach
Qingzhou within three days.

250
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,360
As for Bofeng Tavern's branch,

251
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,160
we'll split the profits
thirty-seventy as agreed.

252
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:19,160
Manager Yan is certainly decisive.

253
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,840
We will await the contract.

254
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:35,800
Father.

255
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:37,120
The wind and sand are heavy outside.

256
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,520
Why did you come out?

257
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:42,200
When you insisted on following
Meng Tinghui to the capital,

258
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:44,880
I was so angry I smashed three tea sets.

259
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,520
But now,

260
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,880
following her has let you see

261
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,720
a wider world.

262
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:52,400
Watching you negotiate

263
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:53,560
with trade guilds from every prefecture,

264
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:57,120
even an old merchant like me is impressed.

265
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,520
My daughter,

266
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,440
you've grown up.

267
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:09,920
Father.

268
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:12,840
Before…

269
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:15,040
you always opposed me appearing in public

270
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,640
and opposed me doing business.

271
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:19,400
This is the first time you've
praised Mengmeng and me.

272
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:23,440
Since Ding Chong fell,

273
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:25,760
I've watched Shazhou's merchant caravans

274
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,360
increase by seventy percent.

275
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:30,480
Not only is business easier for merchants,

276
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:32,640
even poor households

277
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,280
can now afford meat.

278
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:35,960
This stubborn old stone of a heart

279
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:39,680
has slowly been warmed by you two.

280
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:45,320
Silly girl.

281
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,760
All right, all right.

282
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,480
You are now

283
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:51,400
the head of the Yan family's business.

284
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:54,320
You can't burst into tears so easily.

285
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,600
Fuzhi.

286
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:05,880
Zhishu.

287
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:08,320
Master Yan, I came to see…

288
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:11,600
Father-in-law.

289
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:15,840
Do you really think I'm senile?

290
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:18,840
This fake courtship act of yours—

291
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:21,120
how long will you keep it up?

292
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:25,320
Father.

293
00:16:25,400 --> 00:16:27,080
I had no choice.

294
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:29,120
You deceived me first.

295
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,000
I didn't mean to deceive you.

296
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,280
Uncle Yan.

297
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,720
This wasn't Fuzhi's fault.

298
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:37,080
I was the one who said it on my own.

299
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,160
If you must blame someone, blame me.

300
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,600
Enough.

301
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,000
I've thought it through now.

302
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,840
I won't force you to marry.

303
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:48,640
So stop putting on an act for me.

304
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,560
Fuzhi.

305
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:52,000
You are still a woman, after all.

306
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:54,080
You cannot gamble with your reputation.

307
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,280
You may be capable on your own,

308
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,960
and you may earn mountains of gold,

309
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:01,840
but I still hope someone will be there

310
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:04,360
to care for you and cherish you.

311
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,960
Uncle Yan.

312
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:11,000
The act may have been false,
but my feelings are real.

313
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:13,080
Fuzhi and I love each other.

314
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,160
I will never fail her.

315
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:18,280
Hearing that from you, Lord Shen,

316
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:19,560
puts my heart at ease.

317
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,760
You've come a long way as our guest.

318
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:24,160
I'll have food and wine prepared for you.

319
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,520
The military situation is urgent.

320
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:27,880
I came to Fuzhi today

321
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,000
to ask an important favor.

322
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:31,200
Between us, why call it a favor?

323
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:36,120
Fuzhi, this is a grave matter.

324
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:39,000
Qingzhou Camp urgently needs
thirty thousand shi of grain.

325
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,720
It must arrive within seven days.

326
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,320
If we wait for court approval,

327
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,200
the aid will come too late.

328
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,960
I may run taverns,

329
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:48,960
But within seven days,

330
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:51,280
gathering thirty thousand shi
of grain may be…

331
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:55,200
Father, I'm still new
to business in Shazhou.

332
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:57,800
Could you help by acting as guarantor

333
00:17:57,880 --> 00:18:00,120
and buying private grain
from friendly merchants?

334
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:02,160
-Even at a premium…
-Husband.

335
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:03,080
Absolutely not.

336
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,840
Thirty thousand shi of grain

337
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:08,000
would empty our family coffers.

338
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:11,040
The Shen family may be prestigious,

339
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,680
but their annual stipend
is barely a hundred taels.

340
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:14,400
The betrothal gifts haven't even arrived,

341
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:16,480
and now our Yan family must pay instead?

342
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:18,200
If Master Yan is willing to help,

343
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:19,600
I can sign an IOU right now.

344
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:20,960
I will repay every bit someday.

345
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:21,960
Husband.

346
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:25,520
Officials have two mouths:
one to borrow, one to deny.

347
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:27,560
We've seen that before.

348
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:32,000
Do you really want Fuzhi,

349
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:34,320
or are you after our family's money?

350
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,120
Just because you live and breathe money

351
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:38,200
doesn't mean everyone else does.

352
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:39,600
Husband.

353
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:41,920
I'm only thinking of our family.

354
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:44,040
The Yan family's money

355
00:18:44,120 --> 00:18:45,400
doesn't fall from the sky.

356
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,000
How can we throw it around like this?

357
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:52,040
If Lord Shen is urgently gathering grain,

358
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:55,240
could it be those Beijian wolves…?

359
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,280
Master Yan, to tell you the truth,

360
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:01,800
the situation is still unclear.

361
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:02,920
War has not broken out,

362
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,600
but we cannot let our guard down.

363
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:18,240
If Lord Shen came in person,

364
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,800
it must be extremely urgent

365
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,880
and shows his trust in our Yan family.

366
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:24,360
We may be merchants,

367
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:26,520
but we understand duty to our country.

368
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:28,400
Fuzhi.

369
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:30,600
This is my seal.

370
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:32,360
Every Yan family granary

371
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,520
is at your disposal.

372
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:34,760
If that is not enough,

373
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:37,080
from today onward, every Yan shop

374
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,800
will buy grain and sell no other goods.

375
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,600
We'll also purchase private grain

376
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,880
from the other major merchants.

377
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:44,920
Thank you, Master Yan.

378
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,080
I'll write the IOU at once.

379
00:19:46,800 --> 00:19:47,640
Lord Shen,

380
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,800
do you take me

381
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:51,000
for a merchant who cares only for profit?

382
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:51,920
Husband.

383
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:54,120
Even if you won't think of yourself,

384
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:56,480
think of Song'er.

385
00:19:56,560 --> 00:19:58,640
If war truly breaks out,

386
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:01,080
even thirty thousand
shi may not be enough.

387
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,360
Then

388
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,480
what good is a mere IOU?

389
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:06,120
Merchants can only prosper

390
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:07,760
in times of peace.

391
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:09,640
Only because soldiers defend the realm

392
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:12,200
can people like us live
in wealth and safety.

393
00:20:12,280 --> 00:20:14,240
You shortsighted woman,

394
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,240
stop making trouble.

395
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:18,160
Husband.

396
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:20,160
Take Madam back inside.

397
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:22,720
Madam, this way.

398
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:28,720
Madam.

399
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,360
Father, thank you.

400
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,840
On behalf of the soldiers,
thank you, Fuzhi.

401
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:39,920
Thank you, Master Yan.

402
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,000
Silly daughter, worthy son-in-law,

403
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:42,920
why be so formal with me?

404
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,760
Come, get up.

405
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,400
Fuzhi.

406
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:51,880
I'll arrange the grain wagons at once.

407
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,240
I still have urgent duties,

408
00:20:53,320 --> 00:20:54,160
so I cannot stay with you.

409
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,520
Go take care of your work.

410
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:56,640
As for the grain,

411
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:57,840
I'll see it done.

412
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:01,920
Shen Zhishu.

413
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,240
Go on.

414
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:19,680
Shen Zhishu, listen carefully.

415
00:21:19,760 --> 00:21:21,680
I'm famous in Shazhou
for loving handsome men.

416
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:23,880
If you come back with even one new scar,

417
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:25,720
I'll dump you.

418
00:21:25,800 --> 00:21:26,640
Then I'll find ten men

419
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:28,200
even more handsome than you.

420
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:29,120
That won't do.

421
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:32,240
I already have three scars.

422
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:33,600
My father left them when
he beat me as a child.

423
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,920
You'd better inspect them first.

424
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,240
Otherwise, when I return,

425
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:37,600
I might get dumped for nothing.

426
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:39,240
Here. Look.

427
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:40,720
Shen Zhishu.

428
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,240
All right.

429
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,440
I was teasing you.

430
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:56,480
What I mean is,

431
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:58,600
come back safe and sound.

432
00:21:58,680 --> 00:21:59,960
Not even a hair may be missing.

433
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,560
Do you hear me?

434
00:22:15,840 --> 00:22:16,840
Wait for me.

435
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:27,840
I will.

436
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:40,680
Your Majesty.

437
00:22:40,760 --> 00:22:42,920
Beijian's envoy has
submitted three state letters

438
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,760
pressing us for an answer on the marriage.

439
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,520
I…

440
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:48,960
took the liberty of
consulting the ministers.

441
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:52,200
We believe Shen Zhili,
daughter of Grand Tutor Shen,

442
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:53,800
is both virtuous and talented,

443
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,160
gracious and dignified,

444
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:57,400
and worthy to serve as
a model for all women.

445
00:22:58,160 --> 00:23:00,960
I respectfully ask Your Majesty

446
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:03,480
to appoint Shen Zhili as Empress.

447
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:05,600
I second the motion.

448
00:23:08,360 --> 00:23:10,480
Your Majesty, I previously believed

449
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:13,160
recommending Beijian's Divine
Maiden could secure the border.

450
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,400
But after seeing the Left Chancellor

451
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:15,720
so passionately favor resistance,

452
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:17,320
I reconsidered the matter

453
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:19,560
and found his reasoning sound.

454
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:21,240
The Shen family is highly distinguished,

455
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:22,840
a household steeped in
scholarship and propriety,

456
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:24,520
renowned for its spotless reputation.

457
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:26,280
She is indeed the finest
choice for Empress.

458
00:23:26,360 --> 00:23:28,840
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

459
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:33,120
The two Chancellors

460
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:35,600
are remarkably united today.

461
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:36,680
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

462
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:40,720
The Right Chancellor and
I did disagree before.

463
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:42,480
But our agreement today

464
00:23:42,560 --> 00:23:44,080
proves precisely

465
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:46,160
that Miss Shen

466
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:49,040
is the choice the court supports.

467
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,600
The Left Chancellor is correct.

468
00:23:52,760 --> 00:23:55,640
I urge Your Majesty to
appoint an Empress soon

469
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:56,640
to secure the state

470
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:57,960
and continue the imperial line.

471
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:59,440
You have all certainly…

472
00:23:59,520 --> 00:24:00,720
thought of everything for me.

473
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:03,360
But I have always
respected the Shen family.

474
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:07,000
Since you jointly recommend
Shen Zhili as Empress,

475
00:24:07,080 --> 00:24:08,280
shouldn't you first ask

476
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:09,840
Grand Tutor Shen what he thinks?

477
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:10,800
I

478
00:24:11,800 --> 00:24:13,920
feared Your Majesty
might have reservations,

479
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:17,880
so I already asked Grand Tutor
Shen to co-sign the memorial.

480
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:24,160
Your Majesty.

481
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:26,920
The joint recommendation
has been submitted.

482
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:29,880
I will order the Ministry of Rites

483
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:32,400
to prepare the ancestral ceremony,

484
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:35,520
and the Imperial Astronomical
Bureau to choose an auspicious date.

485
00:24:35,600 --> 00:24:37,600
Please issue the decree soon

486
00:24:38,280 --> 00:24:41,440
and announce the
Empress-designate to the realm.

487
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:46,000
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

488
00:24:46,840 --> 00:24:48,720
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

489
00:24:49,360 --> 00:24:51,560
-I second the motion.
-I second the motion.

490
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:03,080
Whatever happens at court,

491
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:05,400
Grand Tutor Shen has
always stood behind me.

492
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,360
Why this time…?

493
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:08,600
I am doing this

494
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:11,720
to end Beijian's ambitions,

495
00:25:11,800 --> 00:25:13,040
and also to end Your Majesty's

496
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:15,520
improper hopes regarding Meng Tinghui.

497
00:25:16,280 --> 00:25:17,880
You may hide it from the whole realm,

498
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:19,240
but you cannot hide it from me.

499
00:25:19,320 --> 00:25:21,480
When Your Majesty rewarded
Meng Tinghui before,

500
00:25:21,560 --> 00:25:22,960
I said nothing

501
00:25:23,040 --> 00:25:25,000
because I trusted Your Majesty's judgment.

502
00:25:25,080 --> 00:25:28,600
But Meng Tinghui's identity
as Zhongwan's princess

503
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:30,960
means she can never be yours.

504
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:33,280
After careful thought, only this

505
00:25:33,360 --> 00:25:36,280
can make Your Majesty
distance yourself from her.

506
00:25:36,360 --> 00:25:37,760
But Meng Tinghui

507
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:40,600
knows nothing of her own origins.

508
00:25:40,680 --> 00:25:43,400
Even if the old Zhongwan
faction has plans for her,

509
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:44,560
I will deal with them personally.

510
00:25:44,640 --> 00:25:46,280
I will never let her be dragged into it.

511
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:50,000
Why must birth create such
an insurmountable divide?

512
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:52,760
The Zhongwan remnants are
undeniably plotting restoration.

513
00:25:52,840 --> 00:25:55,200
If she learns the truth someday,

514
00:25:55,280 --> 00:25:57,480
faced with national and family hatred,

515
00:25:57,560 --> 00:25:59,400
who can predict what she will choose?

516
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:01,000
For Daning's stability,

517
00:26:01,080 --> 00:26:03,120
I dare not rely on chance.

518
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:08,640
The late Emperor granted the Shen
family the Royal Command Tally,

519
00:26:09,320 --> 00:26:11,880
giving me authority over life and death

520
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:13,960
and bringing our family supreme honor.

521
00:26:14,040 --> 00:26:15,280
Today,

522
00:26:16,080 --> 00:26:18,720
With this tally, I implore Your Majesty

523
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:21,040
to accept the Chancellors'
and ministers' recommendation

524
00:26:21,120 --> 00:26:24,480
-and appoint Zhili as Empress.
-Grand Tutor Shen.

525
00:26:27,600 --> 00:26:29,600
Even you would force me?

526
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:33,400
The ministers all have
motives for promoting Zhili,

527
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:34,800
but I promise this:

528
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,560
the Shen family puts Your
Majesty and Daning first

529
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,880
and will never be swayed by any faction.

530
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:41,640
After weighing everything repeatedly,

531
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:43,040
Zhili…

532
00:26:43,120 --> 00:26:46,320
is indeed the best choice for Empress.

533
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:48,800
To avoid suspicion,

534
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:51,800
once the imperial wedding is concluded,

535
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:53,880
I

536
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:57,640
will leave the capital with my wife
and withdraw from public affairs,

537
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:59,400
retiring completely.

538
00:26:59,480 --> 00:27:01,520
Your Majesty, Director Meng
requests an audience.

539
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:07,080
I, Shen Wuchen,

540
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:10,120
implore Your Majesty to decide soon

541
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:12,840
and stabilize the realm.

542
00:27:32,360 --> 00:27:33,360
Your Majesty.

543
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:35,560
Left Chancellor Xu Ting and
Right Chancellor Gu Qin,

544
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:37,840
along with the Six Ministries
and Nine Ministers,

545
00:27:37,920 --> 00:27:39,880
a total of 236 officials,

546
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:41,000
have submitted a joint memorial

547
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:43,440
recommending Zhili as Empress.

548
00:27:44,440 --> 00:27:47,760
Grand Tutor Shen even invoked
the late Emperor's Royal Command Tally

549
00:27:48,360 --> 00:27:50,880
asking Your Majesty, in seven days,
to go to Shengzu Hall

550
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:52,760
and hold the ancestral ceremony.

551
00:27:52,840 --> 00:27:54,280
draft the enthronement decree,

552
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:57,440
and proclaim it to the realm to
secure the imperial foundation

553
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:59,520
and reassure the people.

554
00:28:01,760 --> 00:28:02,600
Fuzhi.

555
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:05,320
When you returned from Shazhou last time,

556
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:07,320
you asked whether I had
feelings for His Majesty.

557
00:28:08,720 --> 00:28:10,440
I hadn't understood my heart then

558
00:28:10,520 --> 00:28:11,640
and denied it in haste.

559
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:14,040
But after facing death
together several times,

560
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:16,760
His Majesty and I have
confessed our feelings.

561
00:28:17,520 --> 00:28:19,440
Because palace rules and
ancestral law forbid it,

562
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:21,960
our love must remain hidden,

563
00:28:22,040 --> 00:28:23,800
yet it is fierce and overwhelming.

564
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:26,440
And now, of all times,

565
00:28:26,520 --> 00:28:29,320
the entire court has
nominated Zhili as Empress.

566
00:28:30,120 --> 00:28:31,760
She is not merely my colleague,

567
00:28:31,840 --> 00:28:33,960
but a friend who has
risked her life beside me.

568
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:37,200
Faced with open and hidden
attacks at court,

569
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:38,280
I have never been afraid.

570
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:41,200
But this situation

571
00:28:41,280 --> 00:28:43,960
has left me troubled for the first time.

572
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,800
The feelings involved are so complicated

573
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,160
that aside from you,

574
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,640
I have no one I can tell.

575
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:15,200
I hope the Left Chancellor will join me

576
00:29:15,840 --> 00:29:17,520
in recommending Shen Zhili as Empress.

577
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:18,880
Everyone knows

578
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:21,120
Shen Zhili is your prized student.

579
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:23,800
Why should I help you
strengthen your power?

580
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:26,520
Meng Tinghui's influence
at court is growing.

581
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:29,200
Her supporters increase by the day,

582
00:29:29,280 --> 00:29:30,600
and she is close to the Shen family.

583
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,680
She…

584
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:34,160
is the greatest threat to both of us.

585
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:36,440
If Grand Tutor Shen rallies the officials

586
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:37,680
to recommend Meng Tinghui,

587
00:29:37,760 --> 00:29:40,040
and His Majesty gives his approval,

588
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,120
then…

589
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,600
neither of us can stop it.

590
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:47,480
If we recommend Shen Zhili as Empress,

591
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:51,000
we can end Meng Tinghui's hopes
of becoming Empress for good,

592
00:29:51,080 --> 00:29:53,280
and drive a wedge between
her and the Shen family.

593
00:29:53,360 --> 00:29:56,200
The Office of Public Inquiry
will inevitably be weakened.

594
00:29:56,280 --> 00:29:57,840
For both of us,

595
00:29:58,560 --> 00:30:00,800
there is everything to
gain and nothing to lose.

596
00:30:00,880 --> 00:30:02,640
Your only concern

597
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:03,960
is that Shen Zhili is my student.

598
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:07,800
But Grand Tutor Shen
heads the Shen family.

599
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,160
Shen Zhishu and Di Nian

600
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,720
are both His Majesty's trusted men.

601
00:30:10,800 --> 00:30:12,040
Which of them…

602
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:15,280
can I truly control?

603
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:17,520
The situation is clear now.

604
00:30:18,080 --> 00:30:19,240
It will be either Meng Tinghui

605
00:30:20,360 --> 00:30:21,280
or…

606
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,360
Shen Zhili.

607
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:25,000
Whom to support as Empress,

608
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:28,160
I trust the Left Chancellor

609
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:30,160
can weigh for himself.

610
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,480
Leyan.

611
00:31:12,520 --> 00:31:13,480
Zhili.

612
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:24,360
My name is indeed on the
Empress recommendation letter.

613
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:27,600
I have nothing to say.

614
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:29,080
Then…

615
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:32,760
all those days of harmony between us,

616
00:31:32,840 --> 00:31:34,400
all those heart-to-heart talks

617
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:36,520
and tender words…

618
00:31:37,840 --> 00:31:39,480
were they only an act

619
00:31:39,560 --> 00:31:41,040
and false affection?

620
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:43,920
Not one bit of my feeling
for you was false.

621
00:31:46,160 --> 00:31:47,840
But the Left Chancellor and your father

622
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:49,440
have united in recommending
you as Empress.

623
00:31:49,520 --> 00:31:51,160
The tide has already turned this way.

624
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:53,280
I had no choice but to do it.

625
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:56,760
Every one of you says you had no choice.

626
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:58,600
Even my usually open-minded parents

627
00:31:58,680 --> 00:32:00,120
have completely changed this time.

628
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:03,400
One avoids seeing me,

629
00:32:04,440 --> 00:32:05,880
and the other refuses to speak.

630
00:32:07,640 --> 00:32:09,280
You all say you love me,

631
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:11,600
but in your eyes,

632
00:32:12,200 --> 00:32:13,320
am I nothing more than

633
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:15,600
a puppet you can move however you please?

634
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:17,400
Does my own will

635
00:32:17,480 --> 00:32:19,040
really mean

636
00:32:19,120 --> 00:32:21,880
so little to all of you?

637
00:32:25,080 --> 00:32:25,920
Leyan.

638
00:32:27,520 --> 00:32:28,840
I regret it deeply as well.

639
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:36,600
Why don't I go to the palace now

640
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:38,760
and confess our feelings to His Majesty?

641
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,960
Even if His Majesty is enraged,

642
00:32:41,040 --> 00:32:43,360
I will bear every consequence myself.

643
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:44,600
Even if I am torn to pieces,

644
00:32:45,360 --> 00:32:47,120
I will not let you suffer for it.

645
00:32:48,040 --> 00:32:49,040
Teacher…

646
00:32:53,360 --> 00:32:54,480
Teacher.

647
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:57,360
You've had too much to drink.

648
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:59,000
What exists between us

649
00:33:00,040 --> 00:33:01,880
will not be accepted by the world.

650
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:03,920
If this becomes known,

651
00:33:05,560 --> 00:33:06,720
not only you and I,

652
00:33:08,320 --> 00:33:11,160
but my parents and the entire Shen clan

653
00:33:12,560 --> 00:33:14,680
will face condemnation and blame.

654
00:33:21,040 --> 00:33:23,120
Leyan, if you are willing,

655
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:26,920
I will take you away right now.

656
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:31,400
I don't care about office or reputation.

657
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:33,120
I can abandon all of it.

658
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:34,920
Even if I am reduced to a commoner,

659
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:37,000
even if we live on plain food for life,

660
00:33:37,080 --> 00:33:38,600
as long as you are beside me,

661
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:40,800
the wilderness will be our paradise,

662
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:42,440
and a thatched cottage

663
00:33:43,080 --> 00:33:44,240
will be our home.

664
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:45,600
Leyan.

665
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:47,960
Trust me.

666
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:07,320
Zhili.

667
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:08,480
You finally came.

668
00:35:08,560 --> 00:35:10,000
I have something to tell you.

669
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:12,200
Yin Qing and I

670
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:13,960
have been investigating
the man behind Ling Yunfei.

671
00:35:14,040 --> 00:35:15,640
We did not mean to hide it from you.

672
00:35:15,720 --> 00:35:17,480
-We only didn't want…
-Director Meng.

673
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:19,600
It doesn't matter anymore.

674
00:35:19,680 --> 00:35:21,440
I have already submitted

675
00:35:21,520 --> 00:35:23,080
my resignation to the
Ministry of Personnel.

676
00:35:23,680 --> 00:35:25,280
This one is for Director Meng.

677
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:27,080
From today onward,

678
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:31,160
we can no longer work together
at the Office of Public Inquiry.

679
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:37,600
You worked so hard to enter government

680
00:35:37,680 --> 00:35:40,200
and earned so much merit at the Office.

681
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:43,040
Will you really abandon it all?

682
00:35:45,640 --> 00:35:47,240
In the end, we are still women.

683
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:48,280
Mengmeng.

684
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:51,200
I'm not afraid of losing
my office or seal.

685
00:35:51,800 --> 00:35:52,680
I'm only afraid

686
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:56,040
of being unable to be with the one I love.

687
00:35:57,200 --> 00:35:58,360
I don't understand.

688
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:01,280
Why can the world not accept us?

689
00:36:02,160 --> 00:36:03,120
You mean…

690
00:36:03,640 --> 00:36:04,480
the Right Chancellor?

691
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:07,880
We love each other.

692
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:11,120
This is the first time in
my life I've loved someone.

693
00:36:11,200 --> 00:36:13,400
Even if it uses up all the
good fortune in my life,

694
00:36:13,480 --> 00:36:14,840
I do not want to give him up.

695
00:36:15,520 --> 00:36:17,120
What I came to tell you today

696
00:36:17,200 --> 00:36:18,360
is precisely about the Right Chancellor.

697
00:36:18,440 --> 00:36:19,280
Zhili.

698
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:21,480
Commander Di.

699
00:36:21,560 --> 00:36:23,600
Tell Zhili what you know.

700
00:36:23,680 --> 00:36:25,160
He has been lying to you all along.

701
00:36:26,040 --> 00:36:28,560
Everyone says Madam Yuan died
protecting the Right Chancellor

702
00:36:28,640 --> 00:36:30,720
from a thief's attack.

703
00:36:30,800 --> 00:36:33,720
In truth, she died by the
Right Chancellor's hand.

704
00:36:34,240 --> 00:36:35,440
Anian.

705
00:36:35,520 --> 00:36:36,920
You're talking nonsense again.

706
00:36:37,680 --> 00:36:40,160
I saw Teacher's grief when
he lost his wife and child.

707
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:41,480
Zhili…

708
00:36:41,560 --> 00:36:44,120
everything he has done was
part of the Empress scheme.

709
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:46,040
If you truly become Empress,

710
00:36:46,120 --> 00:36:47,960
he is the one who benefits most.

711
00:36:48,040 --> 00:36:49,040
Impossible.

712
00:36:49,600 --> 00:36:51,560
-Teacher would never do such a thing.
-Zhili.

713
00:36:52,400 --> 00:36:54,200
Gu Qin does not deserve your devotion.

714
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:55,640
Zhili.

715
00:36:55,720 --> 00:36:57,640
We have been gathering
evidence of his crimes.

716
00:36:57,720 --> 00:36:59,320
We're telling you first

717
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:01,240
because we didn't want you
to hear it from someone else,

718
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:03,360
and we didn't want you to be hurt.

719
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:05,040
I know this is hard to accept,

720
00:37:05,120 --> 00:37:06,280
but it is the truth.

721
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:09,040
Someone can prove all of it.

722
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:47,040
The Qingzhou garrison map you wanted.

723
00:37:47,680 --> 00:37:48,840
Mr. Shangguan.

724
00:37:50,680 --> 00:37:52,960
The Right Chancellor is
well informed indeed.

725
00:37:53,040 --> 00:37:54,040
In only a few days,

726
00:37:54,120 --> 00:37:55,760
you discovered who I am.

727
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:59,960
You killed Ling Yunfei with
the Infinity Pill.

728
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:01,920
Do you think…

729
00:38:02,600 --> 00:38:04,360
you can stay hidden behind him forever?

730
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:06,680
Between the two of us,

731
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:09,880
who truly killed him?

732
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:14,920
Enough idle talk.

733
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:17,280
Where is what I asked for?

734
00:39:48,720 --> 00:39:50,960
It is time you showed your true face.

735
00:40:08,800 --> 00:40:10,680
Everything happened exactly
as His Majesty predicted.

736
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:13,040
They really are after
Qingzhou's garrison map.

737
00:40:20,840 --> 00:40:23,480
The position of Empress
concerns the fate of the realm.

738
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:24,760
At present,

739
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:27,040
both Chancellors are pressing hard,
while Beijian watches like a wolf.

740
00:40:27,120 --> 00:40:30,160
Daning needs a stable inner palace.

741
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:32,160
You are the most suitable choice.

742
00:40:32,240 --> 00:40:34,720
At the ancestral ceremony in seven days,
you will receive the phoenix seal.

743
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:36,760
This is no longer a family matter,
but a matter of state.

744
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:38,080
It is settled.

745
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:40,880
Father, His Majesty and I are
only sovereign and subject.

746
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:43,160
I cannot accept this phoenix seal.

747
00:40:43,240 --> 00:40:45,240
Besides, my heart already
belongs to someone.

748
00:40:46,080 --> 00:40:47,080
What did you say?

749
00:40:50,160 --> 00:40:52,800
Teacher and I love each other.

750
00:40:52,880 --> 00:40:53,720
Father, you would have me

751
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:55,560
with my heart full of love for Teacher

752
00:40:55,640 --> 00:40:56,640
enter the inner palace as Empress.

753
00:40:56,720 --> 00:40:58,000
I cannot do that.

754
00:40:58,080 --> 00:41:00,720
It would mean deceiving His Majesty.

755
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,640
For me, it would tear my heart apart.

756
00:41:03,840 --> 00:41:05,200
Say that again?

757
00:41:06,680 --> 00:41:09,160
Father, even if I say it
ten thousand times,

758
00:41:09,240 --> 00:41:11,360
I still want to be with Teacher.

759
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,320
Our love is sincere and mutual.

760
00:41:12,400 --> 00:41:13,960
The Shen family has been
honorable for generations.

761
00:41:14,040 --> 00:41:15,080
We have built our name on integrity.

762
00:41:15,160 --> 00:41:16,800
I taught you the classics
and proper conduct

763
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:20,000
not so you could defy human propriety.

764
00:41:20,080 --> 00:41:21,640
That fine teacher of yours—

765
00:41:21,720 --> 00:41:23,600
if he cared for you at all,

766
00:41:23,680 --> 00:41:25,960
how could he personally, at court,

767
00:41:26,040 --> 00:41:27,440
push you toward becoming Empress?

768
00:41:27,520 --> 00:41:29,360
Teacher must have his reasons.

769
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:30,480
He said

770
00:41:30,560 --> 00:41:33,120
even if condemned by all
and beset by endless calamity,

771
00:41:33,200 --> 00:41:34,640
he would still grow old with me,
hand in hand.

772
00:41:34,720 --> 00:41:36,040
Come to your senses.

773
00:41:36,120 --> 00:41:37,200
Husband.

774
00:41:37,280 --> 00:41:38,280
Sister Zhili.

775
00:41:43,240 --> 00:41:44,280
In all my life,

776
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,440
this is the first time Father…

777
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:49,680
has ever hit me.
